  {
   "id": "lazy-terminal-body",
   "name": "LazyTerminalBody",
   "exportName": "LazyTerminalBody",
   "zh": "终端懒加载",
   "group": "dock",
   "summary": "侧边栏终端分包的懒加载壳：<code>React.lazy</code> 在终端 tab 首次挂载时才拉取 <code>./terminal.tsx</code>（xterm + FitAddon），外面只套一层 <code>Suspense</code>，fallback 是 <code>null</code>。分包在途时这块面板完全空白——没有 spinner，也没有骨架；到达后原样渲染 <code>TerminalBody</code>，<code>TerminalBodyProps</code> 直接透传。它自己不产生任何 DOM，外观与状态全部由被渲染的终端主体决定。",
   "source": "packages/client/ui-sidebar-terminal/src/client/LazyTerminalBody.tsx#L12",
   "css": [
    "packages/client/ui-sidebar-terminal/src/client/terminal.module.css",
    "packages/client/ui-primitives/src/Button.module.css"
   ],
   "tokens": [
    "--dsw-alias-bg-base",
    "--dsw-alias-bg-l2",
    "--dsw-alias-label-primary",
    "--dsw-radius-md",
    "--dsw-radius-sm",
    "--dsw-alias-button-primary-fill",
    "--dsw-alias-button-primary-hover",
    "--dsw-alias-label-primary-foreground",
    "--dsw-alias-interactive-bg-hover",
    "--dsw-alias-interactive-bg-active",
    "--dsw-alias-border-l3"
   ],
   "specimens": [
    {
     "label": "加载完成后：它渲染出来的终端画面",
     "note": "该组件本身无独立外观，这里展示它挂载后渲染的 TerminalBody",
     "bg": "sidebar",
     "html": "<div style=\"width:420px;height:240px;display:flex\"><section class=\"root\" data-sidebar-terminal><div class=\"screen\"><pre style=\"margin:0\">$ pnpm test\n RUN  v3.2.4 /home/lk/deepseek-harness\n\n ✓ packages/client/ui-chat  (128 tests)\n ✓ packages/client/ui-sidebar-terminal  (21 tests)\n\n Test Files  2 passed (2)\n      Tests  149 passed (149)\n</pre></div></section></div>"
    }
   ],
   "props": [
    {
     "name": "useTabInfo",
     "type": "UseSidebarRightTabInfo",
     "default": "—",
     "desc": "sidebar.right.pane.tab 分享的 tab 信息 Hook，取 tab.id 解析终端模型。"
    },
    {
     "name": "view",
     "type": "(key: string) => TerminalView",
     "default": "—",
     "desc": "按侧边栏出现键解析终端命令面：mount / refresh / connect / write / resize / rename …。"
    },
    {
     "name": "useTerminal",
     "type": "KeyedSnapshotSelectorHook<TerminalViewState>",
     "default": "—",
     "desc": "订阅该 tab 的终端状态（phase、info、render、writable、environment）；undefined 时整棵子树返回 null。"
    },
    {
     "name": "useTheme",
     "type": "SnapshotSelectorHook<ThemeSnapshot>",
     "default": "—",
     "desc": "取当前主题快照，把 terminal 字体族与字号交给 xterm，并在主题切换时更新终端调色板。"
    },
    {
     "name": "t",
     "type": "TranslateNS<'sidebarTerminal'>",
     "default": "—",
     "desc": "sidebarTerminal 命名空间的翻译座位（新建终端、正在连接…、只读、重试等）。"
    }
   ],
   "notes": "它只是 <code>lazy(() =&gt; import('./terminal.tsx'))</code> + <code>Suspense</code> 的包装：分包失败会直接冒泡到外层错误边界，组件自己不处理异常。要看真正的界面请看 <code>TerminalBody</code> 条目。",
   "keywords": [
    "懒加载",
    "终端分包",
    "lazy terminal",
    "xterm",
    "Suspense"
   ]
