     "note": "静态快照",
     "bg": "sidebar",
     "html": "<div style=\"width:420px;height:250px;display:flex\"><section class=\"root\" data-sidebar-terminal><div class=\"status\" role=\"status\">进程已退出（0）<button type=\"button\" class=\"button primary sm\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"actionIcon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M8 2V14\" stroke=\"currentColor\"></path><path d=\"M2 8H14\" stroke=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span></span>新建终端</button></div><div class=\"screen\"><pre style=\"margin:0\">$ pnpm test\n> vitest run packages/client/ui-chat\n Test Files  12 passed (12)\n      Tests  86 passed (86)\n\n$ git status --short\n M ui-chat/src/ChatView.tsx\n</pre></div></section></div>"
